{"id":"original","lemma":"original","pos":"adj","rank":1325,"glosses":["original"],"ipa":"/oɾixiˈnal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"originales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-original.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Qué idea tan original!","en":"What a novel idea!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/604994"},{"text":"Sus ideas son bastante originales.","en":"Her ideas are quite original.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703676"},{"text":"Esa copia difiere del original.","en":"That copy differs from the original.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705522"},{"text":"Él tiene muchas ideas originales.","en":"He has a lot of original ideas.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645364"},{"text":"Nada es realmente original.","en":"Nothing is truly original."}]}